        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Hazel Teapot infostealer sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01663. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Hazel Teapot Infostealer: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01663)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Hazel Teapot Infostealer: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Hazel Teapot infostealer in campaign PTF-01663.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"7c02230fdc8e7b95163200a53c9e5d7e65c43168ad08570f71dc55639a1dd185\", \"25bb766cb7a3829932aafb1e7a22d519444d41e5cb0309b0e1c5af1693000d33\", \"4d1ffd88982a9663b982f99723d27e7a24b0b301441cdc0de94a8864b0d8a74e\", \"71a702ce78a05781280f56498136c0d91f2065df0133712e16fb5386c90a6dc9\", \"b7494f05a3f9b71e82956540204c389cde2bd6d9b65d06890ae47b1b2d785870\", \"e3375ffcd7b411d49efdf181e53a235dec02bf555809268cfee08ab6bab40abe\", \"0b306d52e9487bc580b6dada9da0db655dfac3cda3f3a99544daf1b24a5fec8c\", \"5f453c00d427c2019c72ef0acdf3769cd156efd52fe0eb3bbe3cc9f38f14c8c0\", \"f82745b1537c1fe780aa81f6829aa67d5f4b2e589d98a2946e9838ad417b81a1\")",
